      "en": "The LORD’s word came to Jonah the second time, saying,",
      "ko": "여호와의 말씀이 두번째 요나에게 임하니라 이르시되",
      "source_text_hash": "219c05929d42d699e6b3b244daf780228608218ac320748bafe2acc98bebe350",
      "translation_text_hash": "54edf9611b2fd5523c6cf1ad6e9077acc38f4c31b67644c48049c27b1ae961e1",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "여호와의 말씀이 두번째 요나에게 임하니라 이르시되"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "54edf9611b2fd5523c6cf1ad6e9077acc38f4c31b67644c48049c27b1ae961e1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:JON:3:2",
      "sequence": 22561,
      "chapter_label": "JON 3",
