          "book": "JON",
          "chapter": 3,
          "verse": 3
        }
      ],
      "en": "So Jonah arose, and went to Nineveh, according to the LORD’s word. Now Nineveh was an exceedingly great city, three days’ journey across.",
      "ko": "요나가 여호와의 말씀대로 일어나서 니느웨로 가니라 니느웨는 극히 큰 성읍이므로 삼일길이라",
      "source_text_hash": "92fc3e9bd9a2da2c38c5a7bfad07aa648ebd17ac1d822d8c5256c6d37088aa1f",
      "translation_text_hash": "ecaeb2e0fd5c53e7a1107ad46eb21c1b133a2377317d892c02205ba48832b838",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "요나가 여호와의 말씀대로 일어나서 니느웨로 가니라 니느웨는 극히 큰 성읍이므로 삼일길이라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "ecaeb2e0fd5c53e7a1107ad46eb21c1b133a2377317d892c02205ba48832b838"
      ]
    },
    {
