      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "JON",
          "chapter": 3,
          "verse": 5
        }
      ],
      "en": "The people of Nineveh believed God; and they proclaimed a fast and put on sackcloth, from their greatest even to their least.",
      "ko": "니느웨 백성이 하나님을 믿고 금식을 선포하고 무론 대소하고 굵은 베를 입은지라",
      "source_text_hash": "98380f8c070ddea7ae8c2f3e20c6818f03f163975592b407eecd99a1ed6c00da",
      "translation_text_hash": "ded61677d34089ecf5a5f6d095eeb92daaee761e033596e5c5e4fdffef8cd93b",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "니느웨 백성이 하나님을 믿고 금식을 선포하고 무론 대소하고 굵은 베를 입은지라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "ded61677d34089ecf5a5f6d095eeb92daaee761e033596e5c5e4fdffef8cd93b"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:JON:3:6",
      "sequence": 22565,
